    "name": "Microsoft Dataverse Web Metadata API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Microsoft Dataverse Web API implements OData v4 over the Dataverse data platform that powers Microsoft Power Platform (Power Apps, Power Automate, Dynamics 365). It supports CRUD operations on tables, execution of actions and functions, and metadata queries. Authentication is via Microsoft Entra ID OAuth 2.0 against the org URL.",
